# Markdown list style

Use `*` (asterisk) for unordered list items in Markdown files. Do not use `-` or `+`.

Nested items use two spaces of indentation before the asterisk:

```markdown
* Top-level item
* Another item with a nested list:
  * Nested item
  * Another nested item
```

When editing existing Markdown, convert `-` list markers to `*` for consistency.
